            "Zingbangc hei guang pw the,",
            "Tingzyn ramswng guay #^5",
            "Tingpuk chingc lik the.",
            "",
            "2 Jisu, lakmei nunc khang",
            "Zaengthaekmei tiilou o,",
            "Nuh gaymei suaihiam khou",
            "Mik tanguih ni the.",
            "",
            "3. Saenghmei zingbangc saanv hei",
            "Baanch’ra #^5 gaeklou o,",
            "Kaniw swkaeng bangc khou",
            "Ata gaeklou o.",
            "",
            "4 Lauthwan zip’chyang pwkhou,",
            "Ai zip thau dat pwkhou,",
            "’Thanmei, khanvbamv maekmei",
            "Nang hu khou sw diu. Amen."
